      "background_image_url": "https://assets.quickhub.ai/qh-templates-2/restaurant2.png",
      "background": {
        "kind": "background_photo",
        "generate": true,
        "transparent": false,
        "prompt": "Diagonal two-panel flat-lay background on a square canvas. A solid flat brand-color panel (this template: warm orange) fills roughly the left 40% of the frame; the remaining ~60% on the right is a light neutral surface (this template: white marble/stone). The seam between the two panels runs top-to-bottom at a slight diagonal angle, not perfectly vertical. In the top-right corner, a few natural green leaves and a small sprig of white flowers overlap the frame edge. On the light-surface side, near the right edge, a few whole halved fruit (this template: apricots, cut side showing the pit) sit directly on the surface as a styling accent. Even, soft studio lighting, minimal shadow, clean editorial food/brand aesthetic. IMPORTANT: leave the visual center of the frame empty of any dish, plate, or product — do not generate a subject there. That area is reserved for a separate transparent subject cutout composited on top. No text, lettering or logos anywhere in the image.",
        "reference_url": "https://assets.quickhub.ai/qh-templates-2/restaurant2.png",
        "notes": "All of the design's text (logo, kicker, headline, offer, website) is set in WHITE directly on the left colour panel, so that panel must be a saturated, medium-to-dark brand colour that white text reads clearly on — never pastel, pale, cream or near-white, even when the request asks for soft or light tones (put those in the light surface and the accents instead). The reference photo currently on this layer has its own dish baked into the center; when generating a fresh background, leave that central subject out — it is supplied separately by the circular transparent subject cutout and must not be duplicated in the background itself."
      },
      "text_layer_count": 5,
      "reference_note": "Golden reference exemplar for the 'diagonal split background + circular transparent subject cutout + logo + 5 text layers' composition family. When generating a new template in this style, keep the exact layer count and role structure below — do not add, remove, or merge layers. Per new brief, only these should change: the ROOT background image (regenerated from `meta.background.prompt`, restyled to the new brief's palette/subject), the subject cutout image (regenerated from the `photo` slot's `image.prompt`), and the text copy in the five text slots (rewritten within each slot's `max_chars`/`max_lines`). The logo slot (`locked: true`) is swapped only by substituting the brand's own logo asset — it is never AI-regenerated, recolored, or reframed. See lidojs_templates/TEMPLATE_METADATA_RULES.md for the full rules this exemplar follows.",
