            "prompt": "Top-down (flat-lay) food photography, subject only, isolated on a transparent background: an alpha-channel PNG with no backdrop, table surface, or baked-in drop shadow. Shot from directly above under soft natural light, styled with visible ingredients/garnish, and framed so the subject fills a circular mask edge-to-edge with no empty corners once cropped. Only the food + vessel silhouette should have pixels; everything else must be true alpha transparency, not white or a solid color.",
